WEBVTT

00:17:59.553 --> 00:18:03.641
so the teachers can focus
on the mentoring and the relationship

00:18:03.665 --> 00:18:05.069
and the communications.

00:18:05.093 --> 00:18:06.529
CA: That system you described,

00:18:06.553 --> 00:18:08.608
I'm trying to imagine
someone proposing that

00:18:08.632 --> 00:18:10.508
in the US or in the West.

00:18:10.532 --> 00:18:15.674
And say, we've got this great new system
that's going to monitor your kids,

00:18:15.698 --> 00:18:18.151
notice whether they are paying attention

00:18:18.175 --> 00:18:20.231
and whether they are going to the bathroom

00:18:20.255 --> 00:18:21.577
and how they are doing.

00:18:21.601 --> 00:18:24.387
The initial reaction
would be uproar, I think.

00:18:24.411 --> 00:18:26.807
People would say, "That's way too creepy,

00:18:26.831 --> 00:18:30.091
how dare you, you're invading
my kid's privacy,